      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 포켓몬의 모든 기술을 보기 위해\n계속해서 손가락을 흔들고 있답니다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020BAA8B4E00020AE30C220C7440020BCF4AE300020C704D574000AACC4C18DD574C11C0020C190AC00B77DC7440020D754B4E4ACE00020C788B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그게 무슨 뜻이에요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC8C0020BB34C2A80020B73BC774C5D0C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "굉장하네요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD49C7A5D558B124C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신이 이해했든, 하지 못했든\n일단 설명해 드릴게요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n손가락흔들기라는 기술을 사용하면\n임의의 기술이 나오게 돼요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7740020C774D574D588B4E0002C0020D558C9C00020BABBD588B4E0000AC77CB2E80020C124BA85D5740020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002E00100001BE01000AC190AC00B77DD754B4E4AE30B77CB2940020AE30C220C7440020C0ACC6A9D558BA74000AC784C758C7580020AE30C220C7740020B098C624AC8C0020B3FCC694002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "직접 체험해 보면 바로 이해가 되실 테니\n포켓몬 승부로 보여 드리죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C1C8110020CCB4D5D8D5740020BCF4BA740020BC14B85C0020C774D574AC000020B418C2E40020D14CB2C8000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B85C0020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACC8E0002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부를 하실 거라면\n저에게 말을 걸어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558C2E40020AC70B77CBA74000AC800C5D0AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손가락흔들기에서 어떤 기술이 나올지\n당신의 운을 시험해 보시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C190AC00B77DD754B4E4AE30C5D0C11C0020C5B4B5A40020AE30C220C7740020B098C62CC9C0000AB2F9C2E0C7580020C6B4C7440020C2DCD5D8D5740020BCF4C2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시험한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCD5D8D55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시험하지 않는다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCD5D8D558C9C00020C54AB294B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하긴, 운이 나쁘면 엄청난 기술이 나와서\n당신이 질 테니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558AE34002C0020C6B4C7740020B098C058BA740020C5C4CCADB09C0020AE30C220C7740020B098C640C11C000AB2F9C2E0C7740020C9C80020D14CB2C8AE4CC694002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손가락흔들기에서 어떤 기술이 나올지는\n저도 알 수 없어요!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어느 쪽이 더 운이 좋은지 승부해 봐요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C190AC00B77DD754B4E4AE30C5D0C11C0020C5B4B5A40020AE30C220C7740020B098C62CC9C0B294000AC800B3C40020C54C0020C2180020C5C6C5B4C694002100100001BE00000AC5B4B2900020CABDC7740020B3540020C6B4C7740020C88BC740C9C00020C2B9BD80D5740020BD10C694002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "까딱까딱!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE4CB531AE4CB531002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부에는 졌지만 완전히 진 건 아니에요.\n왜냐하면 처음 보는 기술이 있었으니까요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80C5D0B2940020C84CC9C0B9CC0020C644C804D7880020C9C40020AC740020C544B2C8C5D0C694002E000AC65CB0D0D558BA740020CC98C74C0020BCF4B2940020AE30C220C7740020C788C5C8C73CB2C8AE4CC694002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "손가락을 흔들어 뇌를 자극해서\n다양한 기술을 무작위로 사용한다니...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬의 가능성은 그야말로 무한대!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C190AC00B77DC7440020D754B4E4C5B40020B1CCB97C0020C790ADF9D574C11C000AB2E4C591D55C0020AE30C220C7440020BB34C791C704B85C0020C0ACC6A9D55CB2E4B2C8002E002E002E00100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAACC7580020AC00B2A5C131C7400020ADF8C57CB9D0B85C0020BB34D55CB300002100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만... 손가락흔들기에서\n나오지 않는 기술도 있다고 해요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그 기술을 보기 위해 저는 계속 싸우겠어요!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n충격파가 나올 정도로 손가락을 흔들면서요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신도 손가락흔들기를 꾸준히 사용하면서\n다양한 기술을 확인해 보세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
